# Pocketwatch: can Jian walk and run after the clear? (k_cleared from watch_clear.plan). The drop chest
# lands on Jian (the symbol was pulled onto him), so he is first moved 48 px up, off it
load k_cleared
watch u32 0x020B0010 fstate
poke u32 0x020B6CB8 0x438000
wait 5
peek u32 0x020B6CB4 x0
peek u32 0x020B6CB8 y0
press Up 30
peek u32 0x020B6CB8 y_walk_up
press Left 30
peek u32 0x020B6CB4 x_walk_left
press B,Up 30
peek u32 0x020B6CB8 y_run_up
peek u32 0x020B6CF0 st
press B,Right 30
peek u32 0x020B6CB4 x_run_right
shot m01
